{
  "epId": 4944,
  "name": "無相之冰",
  "desc": "<p><span style=\"color: #FFFFFF\">無相之冰</span></p><p>代號為「塔勒特」的高階冰元素生命。</p><p>似乎很不擅長球類運動…</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/01/29/8d7de2636087ba94e7195a1b0007e1ef_6874961881922603162.png",
